  "description": "Han Ye-Jun, a former second-class idol who visited as a guest of ace host Lee Do-Won, and a radio DJ that Do-Won listens to on her way to work. Although it is the first time for a man, Do-won, who is trying to wipe out Ye-jun, who is a good friend, feels uncomfortable with the money Ye-jun gave him in return.\n\n“I’ll give you the amount you paid, so let’s go to my brother’s house.”\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \n[Bomtoon](https://www.bomtoon.com/detail/seasoninS2/), [Lezhin](https://www.lezhin.com/ko/comic/seasoning_love)\n\n**Official Translations:**  \n[Thai](https://www.lezhinth.com/detail/seasoninS2)",
